msgid "A Facebook group auto poster helps you share a prepared post across the groups you select. Postika combines a post editor, group selection, scheduling, and posting logs in one desktop app."
msgstr "A Facebook group auto poster helps you share a prepared post across the groups you select. Postika combines a post editor, group selection, scheduling, and posting logs in one desktop app."

msgid "A few things to know"
msgstr "A few things to know"

msgid "A little less busywork. A little more time."
msgstr "A little less busywork. A little more time."

msgid "A supported Windows, macOS, or Linux computer, an installed Chrome or Chromium browser, and your Facebook account. Platform downloads are listed on the downloads page."
msgstr "A supported Windows, macOS, or Linux computer, an installed Chrome or Chromium browser, and your Facebook account. Platform downloads are listed on the downloads page."

msgid "Already have a post worth sharing? Import posts from a Facebook page your signed-in account can access. Review the text and images, make your edits, and add the posts you want to your queue."
msgstr "Already have a post worth sharing? Import posts from a Facebook page your signed-in account can access. Review the text and images, make your edits, and add the posts you want to your queue."

