msgid "Choose from 33 interface languages, including right-to-left layouts. Menus, controls, and app-generated log messages follow your choice across windows. And with 189 themes, you can make Postika feel like your own."
msgstr "Choose from 33 interface languages, including right-to-left layouts. Menus, controls, and app-generated log messages follow your choice across windows. And with 189 themes, you can make Postika feel like your own."

msgid "Choose your own minimum and maximum interval between posts to avoid posting in rapid succession and help reduce the risk of rate limits or account restrictions. Follow progress as the queue runs, and pause whenever you need to."
msgstr "Choose your own minimum and maximum interval between posts to avoid posting in rapid succession and help reduce the risk of rate limits or account restrictions. Follow progress as the queue runs, and pause whenever you need to."

